        "text": "<p>Let’s be real — most service businesses don’t have a steady pipeline of high-quality leads. You’re relying on referrals, directories, or just hoping someone stumbles onto your site.</p><p>Without a solid digital strategy, you're invisible to the very people who need you.</p><p>That’s where we come in. We know the Aussie market and how local customers search for trades and services. No generic SEO fluff or Google Ads guesswork — just real strategies built to drive calls, quotes, and bookings.</p><p><strong>We make your phone ring. With the right people.</strong></p>",
