    "faq_iny4eh": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_item_XGXi4Q": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I get more leads for my business?",
            "answer": "<p>Whether you're running a Shopify store or offering plumbing services, getting more leads comes down to having a solid digital strategy. That means being found on Google, running smart ad campaigns, using email marketing the right way, and actually tracking what works. We build and manage systems that bring you leads on autopilot—no fluff.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_9HnVi9": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why does my business need a website?",
            "answer": "<p>Your website isn’t just a business card—it’s your best salesperson. A solid site builds trust, shows off your product or service, and turns browsers into buyers or enquiries. Shopify for eComm, custom builds for service-based—whatever your business, we make it work hard.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_hjYqHP": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What’s the best marketing strategy for small businesses?",
            "answer": "<p>Depends on your goals. For eCommerce, paid ads + SEO + TikTok content = 🔥. For local services, Google Ads + local SEO + reviews = leads. The right marketing isn’t one-size-fits-all—it’s what works for your niche, your margins, and your market.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_mdt7ky": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What platform is better than online directories like HiPages?",
            "answer": "<p>Directories are fine—if you like competing with 100 others for bottom-dollar jobs. If you're serious about building a brand that attracts better clients and bigger orders, you need a website and an ad strategy that puts <em>you</em> in control of the lead flow. Not some algorithm.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_dpLdHH": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are paid ads actually worth it?",
            "answer": "<p>Paid ads are only worth it when they’re done right. We’ve managed $2M+ in ad spend and know how to turn a dollar into ten. Whether it’s Google Shopping, Facebook retargeting or TikTok sales campaigns—we’ve seen what works and what doesn’t. We don’t guess. We optimise.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_M3HRNG": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Where do good customers actually come from?",
            "answer": "<p>Short answer: online. Long answer: Google, social media, email, TikTok, and everywhere your ideal customer is already hanging out. But it’s not just about being <em>seen</em>—it’s about saying the right thing, at the right time, with the right offer. That’s where we come in.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_DcYcJX": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What’s the best way to scale my Shopify store?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with your data. What products are selling, where is traffic coming from, what’s your return customer rate? Then: streamline your site, improve your offer, and run the ads that give you scale. We help you scale with a proven eCommerce growth framework.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_rQtkgF": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do I grow without spending all day on social media?",
            "answer": "<p>Create once, distribute everywhere. We help you turn one video or blog post into multiple touchpoints—from TikTok to Google to email. If you hate being in front of the camera, we’ll script it for you or even shoot it with you. No more guessing, no more burnout.</p><p></p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_pDnJhK": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long until I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>If you’re running ads—sometimes within 72 hours. SEO and organic content can take 3-6 months. The key is momentum. Our goal is to get early wins, then layer in long-term gains so you’re not always stuck on the hamster wheel.</p>",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/yellow-arrow_3e657a2f-2ca2-4c8f-8ef5-7678a9b6fcdb.svg"
          }
        }
      },
